# CO-WP-FEATURE-COMPLETION-001

Status: **Product Owner Direction** · Effective immediately  
Deploy: **Only after Product Owner approval**

## Mandate

Stop creating new modules. Complete existing features only.

## Priority order

1. Professional Identity Card (flagship)
2. Home
3. Business
4. Customer Workspace
5. Opportunity Workspace

## Definition of complete (every screen)

- Every button / navigation / interaction / animation works
- Meaningful empty states · premium loading states
- Remove placeholder behaviour where the feature can be completed today

## Forbidden

- New modules
- EEE / Tier Engine / Entitlements (unless PO reopens)
- Deploy without PO approval
